# KinBech

Nepal local marketplace: nearby buy/sell, chat, meetup. Not a shipping store. Phone OTP (+977) → JWT. Sellers: individual, shop, or both. Listing status: active | pending | sold. Currency NPR. eSewa/Khalti/IME/bank/cash are saved methods, not a payment gateway. Purchases come from chat/meetup, not orders.

This file is the map. Do not read README, PROJECT_REPORT, or Project Documentation, and do not glob the repo, just to orient. Those docs are stale or roadmaps. Open only files for the task. User often writes Hindi/Hinglish; answer in that language unless they switch.

## Where code lives

- `Mobile/` — Expo SDK 57, RN 0.86, JS. `App.js`, `src/screens/`, `src/navigation/AppNavigator.js`, `src/services/api.js`, `src/config/apiUrl.js`.
- `Backend/` — Express 5, MongoDB, Socket.io, port 5001. `src/server.js`, `src/app.js`, `src/routes/`, `src/controllers/`, `src/models/`.
- `Website/` — Vite + React, port 5180. Public: `src/App.jsx`, `src/pages/`. Admin is `Website/src/admin/` at `/admin/*`. There is no separate Admin app.

API mounts in `Backend/src/app.js`: `/auth` `/listings` `/chats` `/wishlist` `/notifications` `/reports` `/reviews` `/shops` `/sellers` `/categories` `/moderation` `/map` `/media` `/ai` `/errors`.

